            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2^{2} (3x-1)+\\log_{(3x-1)}^{2} 2-\\log_2 (3x-1)^{2}-\\log_{(3x-1)} 4+2\\le 0\"></span>.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": []
