              "html": "<p>Дан­ное не­ра­вен­ство рав­но­силь­но не­ра­вен­ству</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"(\\log_{(2)}^{2} (3x+1)+\\frac{1}{\\log_{(2)}^{2} (3x+1)})-4(\\log_2 (3x+1)+\\frac{1}{\\log_2 (3x+1)})+6\\le 0\"></span>. </span></p></center><p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (3x+1)+\\frac{1}{\\log_2 (3x+1)}=t\"></span>,  тогда  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_{(2)}^{2} (3x+1)+\\frac{1}{\\log_{(2)}^{2} (3x+1)}=t^{2}-2\"></span>. </p><p>Далее имеем: <span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}-4t+4\\le 0\\iff t=2\"></span>, от­ку­да</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\log_2 (3x+1)+\\frac{1}{\\log_2 (3x+1)}=2\\iff \\log_2 (3x+1)=1\\iff 3x+1=2\\iff x=\\frac{1}{3}\"></span> . </span></p></center>",
